MapHash":2571801362,"text":"工程を更新？","nextNodeIds":[726970113]},{"nodeId":726970113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3825746602,"text":"意味が分からない…","nextNodeIds":[726970114]},{"nodeId":726970114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":106617810,"text":"うーん、どう説明したらいいものか…","nextNodeIds":[726970115]},{"nodeId":726970115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":3923585290,"text":"例えば、一つ目の工程で夕暮れの実を十個、二つ目の工程で水元素、三つ目の工程で水スライムを二体倒す必要があるとしよう。","nextNodeIds":[726970116]},{"nodeId":726970116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":4244243306,"text":"この「素材収集器」を持って、夕暮れの実を十個収集したら、一つ目の工程に必要な材料がすべて集まったと判断される。","nextNodeIds":[726970117]},{"nodeId":726970117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":3417636234,"text":"そしたら…","nextNodeIds":[726970118]},{"nodeId":726970118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":50885818,"text":"そうか、自動で二つ目の工程の収集モードに入るんだな！","nextNodeIds":[726970119]},{"nodeId":726970119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":3196614954,"text":"その通りだ。「元素チャージ」のモードに切り替わり、水元素を補充する。そして水元素の補充が終わったら、また切り替わって…","nextNodeIds":[726970120,726970121]},{"nodeId":726970120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4047245346,"text":"三つ目の工程に入る…","nextNodeIds":[726970122]},{"nodeId":726970122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":1960230298,"text":"そうだ。あとは水スライムを二体倒すだけでいい。","nextNodeIds":[726970123]},{"nodeId":726970123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1028062154,"text":"たしかに、便利になったな。","nextNodeIds":[726970124]},{"nodeId":726970124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":461532626,"text":"そうだろ。丸一晩かけてこれを改良したんだ。名付けて、究極三位一体…","nextNodeIds":[726970125]},{"nodeId":726970125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1163121338,"text":"「素材収集器」って、本当にすごいんだな。","nextNodeIds":[726970126]},{"nodeId":726970126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3535965130,"text":"確かに。","nextNodeIds":[726970127]},{"nodeId":726970127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":3173052482,"text":"うぅ…","nextNodeIds":[726970128]},{"nodeId":726970128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2315856914,"text":"でも、どうしてこの「素材収集器」をオイラたちに？","nextNodeIds":[726970129]},{"nodeId":726970129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":4277476946,"text":"ははっ、俺はしばらく離島でしか行動できない…だから、材料を集められないんだ。","nextNodeIds":[726970130]},{"nodeId":726970130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":3041910210,"text":"そこで、君たちには引き続き手伝ってほしい。もちろん、おもちゃの売り上げの一部は、君たちに渡そう。それと、おもちゃも無料で一つあげよう！","nextNodeIds":[726970141]},{"nodeId":726970141,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":2818269002,"text":"前にあげた引換券は覚えてるかい？あれを使えば無料で引換ができるから。","nextNodeIds":[726970142]},{"nodeId":726970142,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":402956314,"text":"君が作ったおもちゃだったら、どれと引き換えてくれても構わない。","nextNodeIds":[726970131]},{"nodeId":726970131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":522856234,"text":"いや、オイラたちが頑張って材料を集めても、おもちゃを売ったお金の大半はおまえの懐に入るんだろ！しかも、おもちゃも一つしかくれないなんて…","nextNodeIds":[726970132]},{"nodeId":726970132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2257768858,"text":"#そんな虫のいい話があるか。行くぞ、{NICKNAME}。","nextNodeIds":[726970133]},{"nodeId":726970133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":694882538,"text":"じゃあ…分け前を増やそう。おもちゃは二つ…いや…三つやってもいいぞ？","nextNodeIds":[726970134]},{"nodeId":726970134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4292510474,"text":"行こう、パイモン。","nextNodeIds":[726970135]},{"nodeId":726970135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":1141504314,"text":"四つ！四つだ！これ以上は無理だ！","nextNodeIds":[726970136]},{"nodeId":726970136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":3646639762,"text":"はぁ…本当はおもちゃを全部あげてもいいんだが、万国商会にまだ借金があるんだ…","nextNodeIds":[726970137]},{"nodeId":726970137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":657289234,"text":"可哀想だから許す。","nextNodeIds":[726970138]},{"nodeId":726970138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":37109802,"text":"はぁ…そうだな。オイラたちがおまえの手伝いをしたのもかわいそうだと思ったからだし…決して、分け前のモラと四つのおもちゃのためじゃないぞ。","nextNodeIds":[726970139]},{"nodeId":726970139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":1671038778,"text":"へへっ、二人とも、ありがとう。","nextNodeIds":[726970140]},{"nodeId":726970140,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":2460501426,"text":"これで、ひと安心できる…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":726970121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1124227658,"text":"「コア活性化」の工程に入る…","nextNodeIds":[726970122]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7269701,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_START","LNHLPKELCAL":["30187"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[